WEBVTT

00:15:27.464 --> 00:15:30.217
Now what do all these details amount to?

00:15:30.258 --> 00:15:32.094
What does it all mean?

00:15:32.135 --> 00:15:34.471
Well, at the very least, I'd suggest

00:15:34.513 --> 00:15:39.810
it's really a bit far-fetched these days
to cling to this notion

00:15:39.851 --> 00:15:46.733
that the invention of agriculture meant
a departure from some egalitarian Eden.

00:15:47.359 --> 00:15:51.071
Or to cling to the idea
that small-scale societies

00:15:51.113 --> 00:15:53.782
are especially likely to be egalitarian,

00:15:53.824 --> 00:15:57.995
while large-scale ones
must necessarily have kings,

00:15:58.036 --> 00:16:00.497
presidents and top-down
structures of management.